{"request_id": "quality_real_full_A-q01", "scenario": "quality_real_full_A", "send_offset_s": 0.0, "outcome": "answered", "tier": "full", "ttft_ms": 1106.8, "total_ms": 1106.8, "waiting_ms": 0.5, "working_ms": 1104.6, "retrying_ms": 0.0, "n_429": 0, "retries": 0, "llm_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 1991, "tokens_out": 100, "queue_len_at_admit": 1, "error": "", "question": "What value of label smoothing did the Transformer authors use during training?", "answer": "The Transformer authors used a label smoothing value of ϵls = 0.1 during training [Attention Is All You Need, p.8]. This technique caused the model to become more unsure, which hurt perplexity but improved accuracy and BLEU score [Attention Is All You Need, p.8].", "meta": {"send_offset_s": 1.6400001186411828e-05, "qid": "q01", "tier": "full", "forced": true, "scope": "in", "retrieval_conf": 0.48, "verify_log": [{"verdict": "PASS", "issues": []}], "answer_outcome": "answered"}, "spans": [{"kind": "wait", "name": "admission", "start_ms": 0.1, "end_ms": 0.6}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 0.7, "end_ms": 0.7}, {"kind": "work", "name": "understand", "start_ms": 0.7, "end_ms": 475.6}, {"kind": "work", "name": "retrieve", "start_ms": 475.8, "end_ms": 476.9}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 477.0, "end_ms": 477.0}, {"kind": "work", "name": "draft", "start_ms": 477.0, "end_ms": 835.9}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 836.2, "end_ms": 836.2}, {"kind": "work", "name": "verify", "start_ms": 836.2, "end_ms": 1105.9}], "first_token_at_ms": 1106.8, "qid": "q01", "grade": "correct_and_cited", "grade_reason": "ok", "setting": "A", "setting_desc": "500 chars, 6 pieces, no rerank", "pipeline_tier": "full", "ttft_excl_admission_ms": 1106.3, "total_excl_admission_ms": 1106.4}
{"request_id": "quality_real_full_A-q02", "scenario": "quality_real_full_A", "send_offset_s": 1.108, "outcome": "answered", "tier": "full", "ttft_ms": 903.2, "total_ms": 903.2, "waiting_ms": 0.2, "working_ms": 901.1, "retrying_ms": 0.0, "n_429": 0, "retries": 0, "llm_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 1679, "tokens_out": 120, "queue_len_at_admit": 1, "error": "", "question": "How many identical layers make up the Transformer's encoder stack?", "answer": "The Transformer's encoder stack is composed of a stack of N = 6 identical layers [Attention Is All You Need, p.3]. Each of these layers contains two sub-layers [Attention Is All You Need, p.3]. The decoder is also composed of a stack of N = 6 identical layers [Attention Is All You Need, p.3].", "meta": {"send_offset_s": 1.1081674000015482, "qid": "q02", "tier": "full", "forced": true, "scope": "in", "retrieval_conf": 0.46, "verify_log": [{"verdict": "PASS", "issues": []}], "answer_outcome": "answered"}, "spans": [{"kind": "wait", "name": "admission", "start_ms": 0.2, "end_ms": 0.4}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 0.4, "end_ms": 0.4}, {"kind": "work", "name": "understand", "start_ms": 0.5, "end_ms": 298.7}, {"kind": "work", "name": "retrieve", "start_ms": 298.8, "end_ms": 300.2}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 300.4, "end_ms": 300.4}, {"kind": "work", "name": "draft", "start_ms": 300.4, "end_ms": 632.1}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 632.3, "end_ms": 632.3}, {"kind": "work", "name": "verify", "start_ms": 632.3, "end_ms": 902.0}], "first_token_at_ms": 903.2, "qid": "q02", "grade": "correct_and_cited", "grade_reason": "ok", "setting": "A", "setting_desc": "500 chars, 6 pieces, no rerank", "pipeline_tier": "full", "ttft_excl_admission_ms": 903.0, "total_excl_admission_ms": 903.0}
{"request_id": "quality_real_full_A-q03", "scenario": "quality_real_full_A", "send_offset_s": 2.013, "outcome": "answered", "tier": "full", "ttft_ms": 1086.6, "total_ms": 1086.6, "waiting_ms": 0.2, "working_ms": 1084.7, "retrying_ms": 0.0, "n_429": 0, "retries": 0, "llm_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 2057, "tokens_out": 139, "queue_len_at_admit": 1, "error": "", "question": "How many steps and how many hours did the Transformer base models train for, and on what hardware?", "answer": "The Transformer base models were trained for a total of 100,000 steps, which took 12 hours [Attention Is All You Need, p.7]. This training was conducted on one machine equipped with 8 NVIDIA P100 GPUs [Attention Is All You Need, p.7]. The paper notes that this duration allows the model to reach a new state of the art in translation quality [Attention Is All You Need, p.2].", "meta": {"send_offset_s": 2.012866400000348, "qid": "q03", "tier": "full", "forced": true, "scope": "in", "retrieval_conf": 0.77, "verify_log": [{"verdict": "PASS", "issues": []}], "answer_outcome": "answered"}, "spans": [{"kind": "wait", "name": "admission", "start_ms": 0.2, "end_ms": 0.3}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 0.4, "end_ms": 0.4}, {"kind": "work", "name": "understand", "start_ms": 0.4, "end_ms": 309.0}, {"kind": "work", "name": "retrieve", "start_ms": 309.1, "end_ms": 310.2}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 310.3, "end_ms": 310.4}, {"kind": "work", "name": "draft", "start_ms": 310.4, "end_ms": 784.5}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 784.7, "end_ms": 784.7}, {"kind": "work", "name": "verify", "start_ms": 784.7, "end_ms": 1085.4}], "first_token_at_ms": 1086.6, "qid": "q03", "grade": "correct_and_cited", "grade_reason": "ok", "setting": "A", "setting_desc": "500 chars, 6 pieces, no rerank", "pipeline_tier": "full", "ttft_excl_admission_ms": 1086.4, "total_excl_admission_ms": 1086.4}
{"request_id": "quality_real_full_A-q04", "scenario": "quality_real_full_A", "send_offset_s": 3.101, "outcome": "answered", "tier": "full", "ttft_ms": 58018.0, "total_ms": 58018.0, "waiting_ms": 56904.7, "working_ms": 1110.4, "retrying_ms": 0.0, "n_429": 0, "retries": 0, "llm_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 1663, "tokens_out": 194, "queue_len_at_admit": 1, "error": "", "question": "Why do the Transformer authors scale the dot products by 1/sqrt(dk)?", "answer": "The authors scale dot products by $1/\\sqrt{d_k}$ because, for large values of $d_k$, the dot products grow large in magnitude [Attention Is All You Need, p.4]. This growth pushes the softmax function into regions where it has extremely small gradients [Attention Is All You Need, p.4]. Scaling counteracts this effect to maintain stable gradients [Attention Is All You Need, p.4]. The dot product of query and key vectors, assumed to be independent random variables with mean 0 and variance 1, has a variance of $d_k$ [Attention Is All You Need, p.4]. Without scaling, additive attention outperforms dot-product attention for larger $d_k$ values [Attention Is All You Need, p.4].", "meta": {"send_offset_s": 3.1008072000040556, "qid": "q04", "tier": "full", "forced": true, "scope": "in", "retrieval_conf": 0.526, "verify_log": [{"verdict": "PASS", "issues": []}], "answer_outcome": "answered"}, "spans": [{"kind": "wait", "name": "admission", "start_ms": 0.1, "end_ms": 56904.8}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 56904.9, "end_ms": 56904.9}, {"kind": "work", "name": "understand", "start_ms": 56904.9, "end_ms": 57265.9}, {"kind": "work", "name": "retrieve", "start_ms": 57266.0, "end_ms": 57267.5}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 57267.7, "end_ms": 57267.7}, {"kind": "work", "name": "draft", "start_ms": 57267.7, "end_ms": 57745.7}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 57745.9, "end_ms": 57745.9}, {"kind": "work", "name": "verify", "start_ms": 57745.9, "end_ms": 58015.7}], "first_token_at_ms": 58018.