{"request_id": "quality_real_full_A-q05", "scenario": "quality_real_full_A", "send_offset_s": 61.122, "outcome": "answered", "tier": "full", "ttft_ms": 958.5, "total_ms": 958.5, "waiting_ms": 0.2, "working_ms": 956.8, "retrying_ms": 0.0, "n_429": 0, "retries": 0, "llm_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 2311, "tokens_out": 83, "queue_len_at_admit": 1, "error": "", "question": "How many warmup steps does the Transformer's learning rate schedule use?", "answer": "The Transformer's learning rate schedule uses 4000 warmup steps [Attention Is All You Need, p.7].", "meta": {"send_offset_s": 61.121595600001456, "qid": "q05", "tier": "full", "forced": true, "scope": "in", "retrieval_conf": 0.841, "verify_log": [{"verdict": "PASS", "issues": []}], "answer_outcome": "answered"}, "spans": [{"kind": "wait", "name": "admission", "start_ms": 0.2, "end_ms": 0.4}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 0.4, "end_ms": 0.5}, {"kind": "work", "name": "understand", "start_ms": 0.5, "end_ms": 279.8}, {"kind": "work", "name": "retrieve", "start_ms": 279.9, "end_ms": 281.2}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 281.3, "end_ms": 281.3}, {"kind": "work", "name": "draft", "start_ms": 281.3, "end_ms": 597.6}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 597.8, "end_ms": 597.9}, {"kind": "work", "name": "verify", "start_ms": 597.9, "end_ms": 957.8}], "first_token_at_ms": 958.5, "qid": "q05", "grade": "correct_and_cited", "grade_reason": "ok", "setting": "A", "setting_desc": "500 chars, 6 pieces, no rerank", "pipeline_tier": "full", "ttft_excl_admission_ms": 958.3, "total_excl_admission_ms": 958.3}
{"request_id": "quality_real_full_A-q06", "scenario": "quality_real_full_A", "send_offset_s": 62.082, "outcome": "answered", "tier": "full", "ttft_ms": 1035.4, "total_ms": 1035.4, "waiting_ms": 0.5, "working_ms": 1033.8, "retrying_ms": 0.0, "n_429": 0, "retries": 0, "llm_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 2013, "tokens_out": 174, "queue_len_at_admit": 1, "error": "", "question": "What BLEU score did the big Transformer reach on WMT 2014 English-to-German?", "answer": "The big Transformer model achieved a BLEU score of 28.4 on the WMT 2014 English-to-German translation task [Attention Is All You Need, p.8]. This result established a new state-of-the-art, outperforming the best previously reported models, including ensembles, by more than 2.0 BLEU [Attention Is All You Need, p.8]. The model's configuration is detailed in Table 3, and training took 3.5 days on 8 P100 GPUs [Attention Is All You Need, p.8].", "meta": {"send_offset_s": 62.08185239999875, "qid": "q06", "tier": "full", "forced": true, "scope": "in", "retrieval_conf": 0.852, "verify_log": [{"verdict": "PASS", "issues": []}], "answer_outcome": "answered"}, "spans": [{"kind": "wait", "name": "admission", "start_ms": 0.2, "end_ms": 0.7}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 0.8, "end_ms": 0.8}, {"kind": "work", "name": "understand", "start_ms": 0.8, "end_ms": 327.2}, {"kind": "work", "name": "retrieve", "start_ms": 327.3, "end_ms": 328.2}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 328.3, "end_ms": 328.3}, {"kind": "work", "name": "draft", "start_ms": 328.3, "end_ms": 774.4}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 774.6, "end_ms": 774.6}, {"kind": "work", "name": "verify", "start_ms": 774.6, "end_ms": 1034.9}], "first_token_at_ms": 1035.4, "qid": "q06", "grade": "correct_and_cited", "grade_reason": "ok", "setting": "A", "setting_desc": "500 chars, 6 pieces, no rerank", "pipeline_tier": "full", "ttft_excl_admission_ms": 1034.8, "total_excl_admission_ms": 1034.8}
{"request_id": "quality_real_full_A-q07", "scenario": "quality_real_full_A", "send_offset_s": 63.118, "outcome": "answered", "tier": "full", "ttft_ms": 57908.2, "total_ms": 57908.2, "waiting_ms": 56904.4, "working_ms": 1002.3, "retrying_ms": 0.0, "n_429": 0, "retries": 0, "llm_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 1745, "tokens_out": 129, "queue_len_at_admit": 1, "error": "", "question": "What are Moshi's theoretical and practical latencies?", "answer": "Moshi has a theoretical latency of 160ms and a practical latency of 200ms [Moshi: a speech-text foundation model for real-time dialogue, p.1]. The paper also notes that the system achieves a 160ms theoretical latency while following complex multi-turn conversations [Moshi: a speech-text foundation model for real-time dialogue, p.41].", "meta": {"send_offset_s": 63.11790599999949, "qid": "q07", "tier": "full", "forced": true, "scope": "in", "retrieval_conf": 0.837, "verify_log": [{"verdict": "PASS", "issues": []}], "answer_outcome": "answered"}, "spans": [{"kind": "wait", "name": "admission", "start_ms": 0.1, "end_ms": 56904.4}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 56904.5, "end_ms": 56904.5}, {"kind": "work", "name": "understand", "start_ms": 56904.5, "end_ms": 57263.7}, {"kind": "work", "name": "retrieve", "start_ms": 57263.8, "end_ms": 57264.5}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 57264.6, "end_ms": 57264.6}, {"kind": "work", "name": "draft", "start_ms": 57264.6, "end_ms": 57627.1}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 57627.2, "end_ms": 57627.2}, {"kind": "work", "name": "verify", "start_ms": 57627.2, "end_ms": 57907.1}], "first_token_at_ms": 57908.2, "qid": "q07", "grade": "correct_and_cited", "grade_reason": "ok", "setting": "A", "setting_desc": "500 chars, 6 pieces, no rerank", "pipeline_tier": "full", "ttft_excl_admission_ms": 1003.8, "total_excl_admission_ms": 1003.8}
{"request_id": "quality_real_full_A-q08", "scenario": "quality_real_full_A", "send_offset_s": 121.027, "outcome": "answered", "tier": "full", "ttft_ms": 1078.4, "total_ms": 1078.4, "waiting_ms": 105.2, "working_ms": 971.9, "retrying_ms": 0.0, "n_429": 0, "retries": 0, "llm_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 1977, "tokens_out": 105, "queue_len_at_admit": 1, "error": "", "question": "What frame rate and bitrate does Moshi's neural audio codec use?", "answer": "The Mimi neural audio codec uses a frame rate of 12.5hz [Moshi: a speech-text foundation model for real-time dialogue, p.12]. The provided passages do not specify the bitrate for the codec.", "meta": {"send_offset_s": 121.02740530000301, "qid": "q08", "tier": "full", "forced": true, "scope": "in", "retrieval_conf": 0.7, "verify_log": [{"verdict": "PASS", "issues": []}], "answer_outcome": "answered"}, "spans": [{"kind": "wait", "name": "admission", "start_ms": 0.1, "end_ms": 105.3}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 105.4, "end_ms": 105.4}, {"kind": "work", "name": "understand", "start_ms": 105.4, "end_ms": 460.1}, {"kind": "work", "name": "retrieve", "start_ms": 460.2, "end_ms": 461.7}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 461.8, "end_ms": 461.9}, {"kind": "work", "name": "draft", "start_ms": 461.9, "end_ms": 810.9}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 811.0, "end_ms": 811.0}, {"kind": "work", "name": "verify", "start_ms": 811.0, "end_ms": 1077.7}], "first_token_at_ms": 1078.4, "qid": "q08", "grade": "wrong", "grade_reason": "missing fact 1\\.1 ?kbps", "setting": "A", "setting_desc": "500 chars, 6 pieces, no rerank", "pipeline_tier": "full", "ttft_excl_admission_ms": 973.2, "total_excl_admission_ms": 973.2}
{"request_id": "quality_real_full_A-q09", "scenario": "quality_real_full_A", "send_offset_s": 122.107, "outcome": "answered", "tier": "full", "ttft_ms": 1017.5, "total_ms": 1017.5, "waiting_ms": 0.2, "working_ms": 1015.9, "retrying_ms": 0.0, "n_429": 0, "retries": 0, "llm_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 1605, "tokens_out": 110, "queue_len_at_admit": 1, "error": "", "question": "How many parameters does Helium, Moshi's text language model, have, and how many tokens was it pretrained on?", "answer": "Helium is a 7B-parameter text language model [Moshi: a speech-text foundation model for real-time dialogue, p.8][Moshi: a speech-text foundation model for real-time dialogue, p.3]. It was pretrained on 2.1T tokens of public English data [Moshi: a speech-text foundation model for real-time dialogue, p.3].", "meta": {"send_offset_s": 122.10667059999832, "qid": "q09", "tier": "full", "forced": true, "scope": "in", "retrieval_conf": 0.562, "verify_log": [{"verdict": "PASS", "issues": []}], "answer_outcome": "answered"}, "spans": [{"kind": "wait", "name": "admission", "start_ms": 0.2, "end_ms": 0.3}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 0.4, "end_ms": 0.4}, {"kind": "work", "name": "understand", "start_ms": 0.4, "end_ms": 402.7}, {"kind": "work", "name": "retrieve", "start_ms": 402.8, "end_ms": 404.3}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 404.5, "end_ms": 404.5}, {"kind": "work", "name": "draft", "start_ms": 404.5, "end_ms": 718.2}, {"kind": "wait", "name": "slot", "start_ms": 718.3, "end_ms": 718.3}, {"kind": "work", "name": "verify", "start_ms": 718.3, "end_ms": 1016.7}], "first_token_at_ms": 1017.5, "qid": "q09", "grade": "correct_and_cited", "grade_reason": "ok", "setting": "A", "setting_desc": "500 chars, 6 pieces, no rerank", "pipeline_tier": "full", "ttft_excl_admission_ms": 1017.3, "total_excl_admission_ms": 1017.4}
